  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Efficient Consumption Loan Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is an energy efficient heating appliance and energy efficient housing lending programme to finance heating and housing solutions with reduced emissions and improved environmental and health co-benefits.

&#x2022; It contributes to wider adoption of energy efficient technologies and ultimate shift in consumer behaviour, with 13,459 direct beneficiaries and 1,400,000 indirect beneficiaries
&#x2022; It enables access to affordable finance for energy efficient solutions and addresses key barrier hindering uptake of energy efficiency solutions in Mongolia
&#x2022; GCF participation is expected to enable XacBank to blend its current cost of funds with GCF concessional funding and decrease the interest rate, making its energy efficiency loans more affordable to average households</narrative>
  </description>
